528
00:20:08,366 --> 00:20:09,526
As long as it's not me.

529
00:20:09,896 --> 00:20:11,766
I'm really going to the final.

530
00:20:16,936 --> 00:20:18,706
The final round is just around the corner.

531
00:20:18,936 --> 00:20:21,005
This is the last Last Stage: 24H...

532
00:20:21,006 --> 00:20:23,905
of Street World Fighter: Directors' War.

533
00:20:23,906 --> 00:20:26,845
The three directors must
prove that they deserve to go...

534
00:20:26,846 --> 00:20:30,315
to the finals with colours that
show their styles and identities.

535
00:20:30,316 --> 00:20:33,515
I'm at the last hurdle
before getting to the finals.

536
00:20:33,516 --> 00:20:35,625
Will it be high risk, low return?

537
00:20:35,626 --> 00:20:37,455
Or will it be high risk, high return?

538
00:20:37,456 --> 00:20:39,155
It's the last Last Stage.

539
00:20:39,156 --> 00:20:42,195
Let's do our best until the end.

540
00:20:42,196 --> 00:20:43,965
- Let's go.
- Let's go!

541
00:20:43,966 --> 00:20:45,735
INGYOO came back alive.

542
00:20:45,736 --> 00:20:46,995
You guys thought I had died, didn't you?

543
00:20:46,996 --> 00:20:50,765
Which two will go on to the finals?

544
00:20:50,766 --> 00:20:54,535
We will now introduce the Fight
Judges who'll decide their fates.

545
00:20:54,536 --> 00:20:55,882
(Revealing the Fight Judges
of the last Last Stage: 24H)

546
00:20:55,906 --> 00:20:57,575
(Totally)

547
00:20:57,576 --> 00:20:59,045
(Excited)

548
00:20:59,046 --> 00:21:00,475
I'm curious.

549
00:21:00,476 --> 00:21:02,215
Who? Who is the judge?

550
00:21:02,216 --> 00:21:04,445
Who?

551
00:21:04,446 --> 00:21:06,485
A choreographer who has
created unique performances...

552
00:21:06,486 --> 00:21:09,526
using their own well-defined style.

553
00:21:09,986 --> 00:21:13,895
A director who creates
movements with a distinctive colour.

554
00:21:13,896 --> 00:21:15,095
Who could it be?

555
00:21:15,096 --> 00:21:16,826
- It is...
- Who could it be?

556
00:21:17,166 --> 00:21:19,196
Honey J!

557
00:21:20,596 --> 00:21:22,735
(Judge, Honey J)

558
00:21:22,736 --> 00:21:24,365
Oh, Honey J. Amazing.

559
00:21:24,366 --> 00:21:26,676
(Welcome.)

560
00:21:28,106 --> 00:21:30,145
A choreographer chosen by Usher.

561
00:21:30,146 --> 00:21:33,075
A director who creates performances
that draw global attention...

562
00:21:33,076 --> 00:21:36,086
with a unique sense of style
and creative movements.

563
00:21:36,846 --> 00:21:37,915
- Is it Haeni?
- Is it Haeni?

564
00:21:37,916 --> 00:21:39,385
- Oh, Haeni?
- Haeni!

565
00:21:39,386 --> 00:21:40,485
(The second judge, Haeni)

566
00:21:40,486 --> 00:21:43,485
(Judge, Haeni)

567
00:21:43,486 --> 00:21:44,585
It's Haeni.

568
00:21:44,586 --> 00:21:46,795
Haeni is a judge...

569
00:21:46,796 --> 00:21:50,225
with a style that's
totally unique in Korea.

570
00:21:50,226 --> 00:21:51,865
She's doing well,

571
00:21:51,866 --> 00:21:53,865
not only in the Korean
community but overseas as well.

572
00:21:53,866 --> 00:21:55,965
She has great expression.
She's very detailed.

573
00:21:55,966 --> 00:21:57,005
She's very good.

574
00:21:57,006 --> 00:22:00,175
She recently participated
in a project with Usher.

575
00:22:00,176 --> 00:22:03,446
She has a very unique
but impressive career.

576
00:22:03,706 --> 00:22:06,245
(I'll judge with the eyes of a
hawk, so please look forward to it!)

577
00:22:06,246 --> 00:22:09,115
A director who has
expressed a strong identity...

578
00:22:09,116 --> 00:22:13,255
in countless performances
through a unique colour and style.

579
00:22:13,256 --> 00:22:14,455
Rie Hata!

580
00:22:14,456 --> 00:22:17,125
(The last judge, Rie Hata)

581
00:22:17,126 --> 00:22:19,295
Rie Hata!

582
00:22:19,296 --> 00:22:21,326
The queen is back! The queen is here!

583
00:22:21,526 --> 00:22:24,465
(She's the best.)

584
00:22:24,466 --> 00:22:27,395
(Team INGYOO welcomes her very excitedly.)

585
00:22:27,396 --> 00:22:31,366
Rie Hata is so good, that
I almost want to hate her.

586
00:22:31,606 --> 00:22:32,805
Starting with her dancing...

587
00:22:32,806 --> 00:22:33,905
(Her strong choreography
skills are a given.)

588
00:22:33,906 --> 00:22:35,275
(She proved her talent
with great film directing...)

589
00:22:35,276 --> 00:22:36,676
(in the Class Mission last season.)

590
00:22:36,906 --> 00:22:39,315
Her composition and
talent are both top-notch.

591
00:22:39,316 --> 00:22:42,045
I really highly evaluate
Rie Hata's composition.

592
00:22:42,046 --> 00:22:44,445
We're meeting at such a good time.

593
00:22:44,446 --> 00:22:46,755
I think she'll understand...

594
00:22:46,756 --> 00:22:49,955
why I created such a performance
and what I want to show.

595
00:22:49,956 --> 00:22:52,195
How have they each
interpreted their own colours...

596
00:22:52,196 --> 00:22:53,825
and portrayed that in their works?

597
00:22:53,826 --> 00:22:56,265
How well have they
brought those ideas to life...

598
00:22:56,266 --> 00:22:58,565
in their performances and productions?

599
00:22:58,566 --> 00:23:02,205
Fight Judge Honey J, what
standards will you judge by?

600
00:23:02,206 --> 00:23:06,175
I'll give high scores to whoever...

601
00:23:06,176 --> 00:23:08,305
clearly shows their colour.

602
00:23:08,306 --> 00:23:10,775
I think being a good director...

603
00:23:10,776 --> 00:23:13,875
is about bringing out the potential...

604
00:23:13,876 --> 00:23:17,385
in yourself and the
dancers you're working with.

605
00:23:17,386 --> 00:23:19,615
I'll objectively judge each
director's capabilities...

606
00:23:19,616 --> 00:23:21,255
and their level of perfection.

607
00:23:21,256 --> 00:23:24,485
It's a cruel mission where
you're only given 24 hours.

608
00:23:24,486 --> 00:23:28,795
I'll judge their mental resilience
as creators and entertainers.

609
00:23:28,796 --> 00:23:31,665
I want to do this well so
people can enjoy themselves.

610
00:23:31,666 --> 00:23:34,965
If I enjoy myself, I think
I'll have a good chance.

611
00:23:34,966 --> 00:23:36,605
I've created a performance...

612
00:23:36,606 --> 00:23:39,935
full of wow factors everyone will enjoy.

613
00:23:39,936 --> 00:23:40,936
I have to survive.

614
00:23:40,937 --> 00:23:43,245
I created so many wow
factors. I have to survive.

615
00:23:43,246 --> 00:23:45,075
I can't be knocked out here.

616
00:23:45,076 --> 00:23:46,545
I have to go to the finals.

617
00:23:46,546 --> 00:23:48,016
No matter what.

618
00:23:48,076 --> 00:23:53,056
We will now begin the performances
for the last Last Stage: 24H.

619
00:23:53,586 --> 00:23:55,856
Ready? Fight!

620
00:23:56,586 --> 00:24:00,156
The first director who will
put on their Last Stage...

621
00:24:00,496 --> 00:24:01,655
is BADA.

622
00:24:01,656 --> 00:24:04,066
(The first director, BADA)

623
00:24:08,266 --> 00:24:10,506
(I want to go see BADA, baby.)

624
00:24:12,406 --> 00:24:13,406
Let's go!

625
00:24:13,407 --> 00:24:15,046
(Let's go, BADA!)

626
00:24:16,476 --> 00:24:18,415
- So cool.
- It's blue.

627
00:24:18,416 --> 00:24:20,115
When I saw her outfit,

628
00:24:20,116 --> 00:24:22,315
I went, "That's it, BADA.
That's what you have to do."

629
00:24:22,316 --> 00:24:23,345
Just by her outfit.

630
00:24:23,346 --> 00:24:25,315
- Like a Grand Duke of the North.
- Grand Duke BADA.

631
00:24:25,316 --> 00:24:28,215
Director BADA. Please
give us a brief description...

632
00:24:28,216 --> 00:24:31,285
of how you interpreted and portrayed...

633
00:24:31,286 --> 00:24:33,725
this symbolic colour of
yours in today's performance.

634
00:24:33,726 --> 00:24:36,365
Since this is the last Last Stage,

635
00:24:36,366 --> 00:24:38,795
I wanted to do something
that I was very good at.

636
00:24:38,796 --> 00:24:40,765
A style that's unique to me.

637
00:24:40,766 --> 00:24:44,205
That is the main concept and colour...

638
00:24:44,206 --> 00:24:46,306
of this performance.

639
00:24:46,806 --> 00:24:48,946
(Excited)

640
00:24:49,806 --> 00:24:53,115
I see this colour as my identity.

641
00:24:53,116 --> 00:24:55,185
This blue is BADA.

642
00:24:55,186 --> 00:24:56,915
Then I need to prove myself.

643
00:24:56,916 --> 00:25:00,455
The things I've gotten so good
at throughout my life as a dancer,

644
00:25:00,456 --> 00:25:02,855
the things I'm so confident about,
the things I can beat anyone with.

645
00:25:02,856 --> 00:25:03,885
Let's make a performance with those things.

646
00:25:03,886 --> 00:25:06,555
It could be my last performance
on Street World Fighter.

647
00:25:06,556 --> 00:25:08,595
Whenever I think it's my last chance,

648
00:25:08,596 --> 00:25:10,425
I can't help but step up.

649
00:25:10,426 --> 00:25:13,635
So I was thinking of
creating a "boss" image...

650
00:25:13,636 --> 00:25:16,906
by putting myself in
the center wearing blue,

651
00:25:17,106 --> 00:25:19,205
but it felt a bit weak.

652
00:25:19,206 --> 00:25:20,875
The fur jacket was cropped.

653
00:25:20,876 --> 00:25:22,175
This has no impact.

654
00:25:22,176 --> 00:25:25,115
It didn't have the majestic
feeling I was imagining.

655
00:25:25,116 --> 00:25:29,115
Maybe we should've gone
with a long sleeveless design.

656
00:25:29,116 --> 00:25:31,186
I think that'd give more of a "boss" feel.

657
00:25:31,286 --> 00:25:33,185
Something Longer. Like a Grand Prince.

658
00:25:33,186 --> 00:25:35,956
I said I wanted something
that had more of a "boss" feel.

659
00:25:36,186 --> 00:25:37,885
- That's nice.
- I like this. This is it.

660
00:25:37,886 --> 00:25:39,332
The longer one is much better, right?

661
00:25:39,356 --> 00:25:40,356
(A total boss)

662
00:25:40,496 --> 00:25:42,195
We can cut here and connect it.

663
00:25:42,196 --> 00:25:43,196
It's so pretty.

664
00:25:43,197 --> 00:25:45,095
They fixed the costume...

665
00:25:45,096 --> 00:25:47,366
by sewing each part of the fabric by hand.

666
00:25:50,566 --> 00:25:53,705
That's how we were able to create
the perfect, boss-like fur jacket.

667
00:25:53,706 --> 00:25:54,806
I'm the boss around here.

668
00:25:55,176 --> 00:25:56,476
It's cool.

669
00:25:56,746 --> 00:25:58,045
(This is it!)

670
00:25:58,046 --> 00:26:00,045
Let's create looks that have strong auras,

671
00:26:00,046 --> 00:26:01,815
even when we're just standing.

672
00:26:01,816 --> 00:26:05,085
Even the position of the fur
pieces on the dancers' outfits.

673
00:26:05,086 --> 00:26:07,285
Let's think of our positions
in the last formation...

674
00:26:07,286 --> 00:26:08,755
to decide whether to
put it on the waist or...

675
00:26:08,756 --> 00:26:11,025
Should it be worn like an
armband or go around the waist?

676
00:26:11,026 --> 00:26:12,895
We looked at those details.

677
00:26:12,896 --> 00:26:16,165
And in terms of the
concept of the choreography,

678
00:26:16,166 --> 00:26:19,835
I chose the keywork, "Last
Shot," the title of the song.

679
00:26:19,836 --> 00:26:21,735
The Last Stage ends with just one shot.

680
00:26:21,736 --> 00:26:23,566
It's a one-shot, one-kill situation.

681
00:26:24,366 --> 00:26:27,175
In this fierce stage of survival,

682
00:26:27,176 --> 00:26:29,276
who will be the star of this last shot?

683
00:26:29,606 --> 00:26:31,146
Then Russian roulette is perfect.

684
00:26:31,176 --> 00:26:32,176
In Russian roulette,

685
00:26:32,177 --> 00:26:35,146
you don't know where the bullet is.

686
00:26:35,246 --> 00:26:37,645
Will I be the one who gets
knocked out by this one shot...

687
00:26:37,646 --> 00:26:39,385
or will it be someone else?

688
00:26:39,386 --> 00:26:40,855
Nobody knows.

689
00:26:40,856 --> 00:26:44,155
I wanted to portray that special tension...

690
00:26:44,156 --> 00:26:45,956
of Russian roulette in my performance.

691
00:26:45,996 --> 00:26:48,025
In Russian roulette, you use a gun.

692
00:26:48,026 --> 00:26:49,525
Then we have to use a gun.

693
00:26:49,526 --> 00:26:51,395
So right here, a gunshot sound or...

694
00:26:51,396 --> 00:26:53,496
- You want a gunshot sound, right?
- Yes.

695
00:26:53,536 --> 00:26:56,806
I came up with all of the ideas
for sound effects and such.

696
00:26:56,936 --> 00:27:00,276
I also saw that the stage was
surrounded by an LED screen.

697
00:27:00,336 --> 00:27:02,575
Should I try using this curve?

698
00:27:02,576 --> 00:27:03,705
I had that idea.

699
00:27:03,706 --> 00:27:05,045
Shoot the gun.

700
00:27:05,046 --> 00:27:08,145
Then the bullet could come back to me.

701
00:27:08,146 --> 00:27:09,415
I wanted to portray that.

702
00:27:09,416 --> 00:27:11,045
I really wanted to portray...

703
00:27:11,046 --> 00:27:12,756
this Russian roulette concept.

704
00:27:12,856 --> 00:27:14,656
This is the last Last Stage.

705
00:27:14,716 --> 00:27:16,185
In this Russian roulette,

706
00:27:16,186 --> 00:27:18,156
this game, this survival,

707
00:27:18,186 --> 00:27:19,595
I want to come out as the winner.

708
00:27:19,596 --> 00:27:20,895
I'll do my best...

709
00:27:20,896 --> 00:27:22,065
so that one last shot...

710
00:27:22,066 --> 00:27:23,166
doesn't hit me.

711
00:27:23,466 --> 00:27:24,566
(Great ambition)

712
00:27:27,036 --> 00:27:29,036
We already have a story.

713
00:27:30,136 --> 00:27:33,075
BADA's Last Stage: 24H,

714
00:27:33,076 --> 00:27:35,905
perfected in 24 hours
with her unique colour,

715
00:27:35,906 --> 00:27:37,506
begins now.

716
00:27:37,806 --> 00:27:39,415
(Let's gather our energy.)

717
00:27:39,416 --> 00:27:41,345
- Let's shoot!
- Let's shoot!

718
00:27:41,346 --> 00:27:42,545
(Let's shoot!)

719
00:27:42,546 --> 00:27:44,045
Since it's the last Last Stage,

720
00:27:44,046 --> 00:27:45,115
I think she'll give us...

721
00:27:45,116 --> 00:27:46,986
a performance that is truly "BADA."

722
00:27:47,016 --> 00:27:50,856
I predict she prepared a
very strong and intense stage.

723
00:27:51,426 --> 00:27:54,126
It's just one more step up to the finals.

724
00:27:54,596 --> 00:27:55,626
I have to survive.

725
00:27:59,036 --> 00:28:00,495
(Overall concept, A combination
of Russian roulette and survival)

726
00:28:00,496 --> 00:28:02,242
(Objet utilization strategy, The
gun is used to show BADA's genre.)

727
00:28:02,266 --> 00:28:03,436
Let's go!

728
00:28:05,066 --> 00:28:07,275
How does she have such a strong aura...

729
00:28:07,276 --> 00:28:08,375
- just by posing like that...
- Oh, my.

730
00:28:08,376 --> 00:28:10,506
(Performance by Team BADA, "Last Shot")

731
00:28:13,116 --> 00:28:14,816
She really is a boss.

732
00:28:15,546 --> 00:28:16,846
Okay, the gun is loaded.

733
00:28:21,186 --> 00:28:22,225
Oh, my gosh.

734
00:28:22,226 --> 00:28:23,486
Is it Russian roulette?

735
00:28:32,166 --> 00:28:33,366
Oh, this is intense.

736
00:28:36,866 --> 00:28:38,436
She's seriously a top player.

737
00:28:39,676 --> 00:28:40,736
Oh, my.

738
00:28:47,916 --> 00:28:48,946
(Impressed)

739
00:28:49,086 --> 00:28:50,185
The cloning technique.

740
00:28:50,186 --> 00:28:51,986
They're really synchronized.

741
00:29:00,156 --> 00:29:01,856
(Loving it)

742
00:29:12,636 --> 00:29:13,975
The dancing was great.

743
00:29:13,976 --> 00:29:15,236
They were so good at dancing.

744
00:29:23,986 --> 00:29:25,046
(Let's go!)

745
00:29:31,356 --> 00:29:32,625
This is BADA's strength.

746
00:29:32,626 --> 00:29:34,096
Even her hair dances.

747
00:29:41,936 --> 00:29:43,305
- Oh, my!
- The bullet has to go around.

748
00:29:43,306 --> 00:29:44,806
(Where is it going?)

749
00:29:47,436 --> 00:29:49,806
She did a good job with
the cinematic production.

750
00:29:53,676 --> 00:29:55,646
BADA's performance is pure dopamine.

751
00:30:07,356 --> 00:30:08,796
Oh, my gosh.

752
00:30:10,396 --> 00:30:11,996
(What an insane ending.)

753
00:30:15,806 --> 00:30:18,035
(Street World Fighter: Directors'
War National Tour Concert)

754
00:30:18,036 --> 00:30:19,705
This is unbelievable.

755
00:30:19,706 --> 00:30:20,876
In 24 hours...

756
00:30:21,236 --> 00:30:23,175
I truly felt it was a perfect performance,

757
00:30:23,176 --> 00:30:25,276
so I have no regrets at all.

758
00:30:27,316 --> 00:30:28,616
It was cool.

759
00:30:28,676 --> 00:30:30,116
It was definitely dynamic.

760
00:30:30,186 --> 00:30:32,555
I think BADA's overwhelming energy...

761
00:30:32,556 --> 00:30:34,755
was very well displayed
in that performance.

762
00:30:34,756 --> 00:30:37,655
She showed what she was good at...

763
00:30:37,656 --> 00:30:39,225
in a very clear and multifaceted way.

764
00:30:39,226 --> 00:30:41,095
"This is BADA. I am BADA."

765
00:30:41,096 --> 00:30:42,165
"I am Bada Lee."

766
00:30:42,166 --> 00:30:43,166
She really sends that message.

767
00:30:43,167 --> 00:30:44,925
And that was so cool.

768
00:30:44,926 --> 00:30:46,965
The one weakness...

769
00:30:46,966 --> 00:30:49,736
