was their starting point.

1562
01:08:15,576 --> 01:08:17,645
But with INGYOO,

1563
01:08:17,646 --> 01:08:20,446
it felt like the Last Stage...

1564
01:08:20,606 --> 01:08:22,975
was his starting point.

1565
01:08:22,976 --> 01:08:25,715
- Any colour, it'd be his Last Stage.
- Exactly.

1566
01:08:25,716 --> 01:08:27,485
This colour or that,
it's still his Last Stage.

1567
01:08:27,486 --> 01:08:29,815
Coming up with choreography...

1568
01:08:29,816 --> 01:08:33,325
