and directing in depth,

1571
01:08:40,426 --> 01:08:43,066
I think choosing that harder path...

1572
01:08:43,336 --> 01:08:46,465
and focusing on it meant...

1573
01:08:46,466 --> 01:08:48,575
Koo Young and BADA...

1574
01:08:48,576 --> 01:08:51,476
