1577
01:08:59,486 --> 01:09:03,155
- That was a bit of a shame.
- Right. It's true...

1578
01:09:03,156 --> 01:09:05,355
As for his skills as a director,

1579
01:09:05,356 --> 01:09:08,556
he did show another side of them.

1580
01:09:08,596 --> 01:09:12,295
But weighed against what he had to give up,

1581
01:09:12,296 --> 01:09:13,866
was it a winning move?

1582
01:09:14,196 --> 01:09:17,196
Did that sacrifice give him...

1583
01:09:17,266 --> 01:09:20,036
an edge over BADA and Koo Young?

1584
01:09:20,466 --> 01:09:22,866
- I think it fell a little short.
- But earlier, honestly...

1585
01:09:25,006 --> 01:09:28,245
How I want to create and develop my art...

1586
01:09:28,246 --> 01:09:30,615
how I want to dance...

1587
01:09:30,616 --> 01:09:33,216
write songs and sing...

1588
01:09:33,346 --> 01:09:35,886
has become so clear
to me through this show.

1589
01:09:36,056 --> 01:09:38,356
Being eliminated is one thing,

1590
01:09:38,456 --> 01:09:40,926
but through great art and dance...

1591
01:09:41,526 --> 01:09:43,525
and content,

1592
01:09:43,526 --> 01:09:46,796
I hope to keep bringing people joy.

1593
01:09:47,496 --> 01:09:48,766
That's all.

1594
01:09:49,696 --> 01:09:52,005
- You did great!
- You did great!

1595
01:09:52,006 --> 01:09:53,536
Green INGYOO!

1596
01:09:54,006 --> 01:09:57,635
I went through a moment
like this just about a year ago.

1597
01:09:57,636 --> 01:10:01,776
It brought back those
memories, and got me emotional.

1598
01:10:02,216 --> 01:10:05,216
Today, I'm here as a judge,

1599
01:10:05,446 --> 01:10:08,985
