1625
01:11:27,026 --> 01:11:29,766
You're a really amazing person.

1626
01:11:30,496 --> 01:11:33,636
I hope you become an ambassador
for health in the dance world.

1627
01:11:34,906 --> 01:11:38,076
I want us to dance together in a healthy,

1628
01:11:38,276 --> 01:11:41,275
