1629
01:11:41,276 --> 01:11:43,076
- Well done.
- Thank you!

1630
01:11:45,046 --> 01:11:47,215
You said you wanted
to do something like this.

1631
01:11:47,216 --> 01:11:48,786
I want to do this.

1632
01:11:48,856 --> 01:11:49,915
You did it today.

1633
01:11:49,916 --> 01:11:52,055
You did something we could enjoy together.

1634
01:11:52,056 --> 01:11:54,155
Well done, everyone.

1635
01:11:54,156 --> 01:11:55,755
Well done, INGYOO.

1636
01:11:55,756 --> 01:11:57,125
All the best.

1637
01:11:57,126 --> 01:12:00,025
I'm a free soul now.

1638
01:12:00,026 --> 01:12:02,786
(The directors are united by their
passion for dance and their work.)

1639
01:12:03,336 --> 01:12:04,735
It's like watching a coming-of-age movie.

1640
01:12:04,736 --> 01:12:06,736
Thank you.

1641
01:12:07,606 --> 01:12:09,006
