1657
01:12:49,916 --> 01:12:52,586
"Do I want to do this or not?"

1658
01:12:53,046 --> 01:12:57,756
I started the show with
these thoughts in mind.

1659
01:12:58,486 --> 01:13:01,025
While competing...

1660
01:13:01,026 --> 01:13:02,946
