with other great directors,

1661
01:13:03,126 --> 01:13:04,395
(What about this?)

1662
01:13:04,396 --> 01:13:06,226
- That's also nice.
- Nice.

1663
01:13:06,526 --> 01:13:08,136
That's not bad.

1664
01:13:08,196 --> 01:13:10,165
We can bump into each other with our backs.

1665
01:13:10,166 --> 01:13:11,506
We can move away and...

1666
01:13:12,006 --> 01:13:14,136
