1671
01:13:26,346 --> 01:13:28,886
The appearance of a character
who has never existed before.

1672
01:13:29,356 --> 01:13:30,636
I'll definitely convince people.

1673
01:13:31,586 --> 01:13:33,656
I think I've earned enough recognition...

1674
01:13:34,056 --> 01:13:36,826
