1675
01:13:37,026 --> 01:13:40,195
I think I'm more confident...

1676
01:13:40,196 --> 01:13:43,336
about my abilities, my
talent, and my thoughts.

1677
01:13:43,436 --> 01:13:46,136
It was a time when I truly learned...

1678
01:13:46,566 --> 01:13:48,805
