1690
01:14:11,766 --> 01:14:15,296
I applaud you for what you tried today.

1691
01:14:17,366 --> 01:14:20,105
It's hard to take the first step.

1692
01:14:20,106 --> 01:14:22,006
It was quite tough.

1693
01:14:22,136 --> 01:14:23,375
I think you did a great job.

1694
01:14:23,376 --> 01:14:25,946
- You did a great job.
- Thank you.

1695
01:14:26,376 --> 01:14:29,515
All the best to you.

1696
01:14:29,516 --> 01:14:31,686
Our cool guy is leaving.

1697
01:14:31,716 --> 01:14:32,786
Goodness.

1698
01:14:33,286 --> 01:14:35,056
I'll return to being a free soul.

1699
01:14:35,416 --> 01:14:37,485
- Well done.
- I managed to stay here...

1700
01:14:37,486 --> 01:14:39,155
