1701
01:14:39,156 --> 01:14:40,625
- I had so much fun.
- You...

1702
01:14:40,626 --> 01:14:42,595
made me stronger.

1703
01:14:42,596 --> 01:14:43,796
I didn't.

1704
01:14:44,096 --> 01:14:46,495
The person I learned the most...

1705
01:14:46,496 --> 01:14:48,195
