1708
01:14:52,536 --> 01:14:53,765
I learned a lot too.

1709
01:14:53,766 --> 01:14:55,576
Thank you so much.

1710
01:14:55,736 --> 01:14:58,246
I loved being able to inspire others,

1711
01:14:58,506 --> 01:15:00,805
set an example,

1712
01:15:00,806 --> 01:15:05,046
get encouraged to take on new challenges,

1713
01:15:05,146 --> 01:15:06,185
