1717
01:15:13,986 --> 01:15:16,126
(An innovative director
and an artist who loves art)

1718
01:15:16,256 --> 01:15:17,825
(Going Green, )

1719
01:15:17,826 --> 01:15:19,766
(toward a bright future for INGYOO!)

1720
01:15:20,726 --> 01:15:23,266
When the music plays

1721
01:15:24,466 --> 01:15:26,436
Street World Fighter: Directors' War...

1722
01:15:26,606 --> 01:15:30,606
