1728
01:15:45,726 --> 01:15:49,256
The last mission given
to the four finalists...

1729
01:15:49,356 --> 01:15:51,356
The moment when sports
reaches its peak intensity.

1730
01:15:51,526 --> 01:15:54,295
The performance that completes
the energy in the stadium.

1731
01:15:54,296 --> 01:15:55,535
Your next challenge will be...

1732
01:15:55,536 --> 01:15:57,765
