1742
01:16:20,586 --> 01:16:23,356
I think that could help me make a
cheering performance of my own.

1743
01:16:23,856 --> 01:16:26,066
I plan to work with swimming.

1744
01:16:26,166 --> 01:16:27,926
Swimming is a battle you fight alone.

1745
01:16:27,996 --> 01:16:30,995
