athletes could also relate to.

1748
01:16:36,106 --> 01:16:38,906
I think the message of
empathy will get across.

1749
01:16:38,946 --> 01:16:41,975
Something I've looked
up to for a long time.

1750
01:16:41,976 --> 01:16:43,046
Esports.

1751
01:16:43,416 --> 01:16:47,315
I'm going to create a scene
where ten people fight each other.

1752
01:16:47,316 --> 01:16:49,755
