alone, you aren't alone.

1759
01:17:03,136 --> 01:17:04,136
You can do it!

1760
01:17:04,137 --> 01:17:07,206
We can layer cheers
and voices like these...

1761
01:17:07,436 --> 01:17:09,235
I think I can create an amazing stage...

1762
01:17:09,236 --> 01:17:11,035
