1764
01:17:13,546 --> 01:17:15,975
To great and healthy performances.

1765
01:17:15,976 --> 01:17:17,375
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

1766
01:17:17,376 --> 01:17:18,945
- Good luck.
- Good luck.

1767
01:17:18,946 --> 01:17:20,285
It's true that I feel the pressure...

1768
01:17:20,286 --> 01:17:22,985
