with our names on it.

1770
01:17:25,456 --> 01:17:28,255
I think I made it this far
because of that determination.

1771
01:17:28,256 --> 01:17:30,825
There's a moment I still remember vividly.

1772
01:17:30,826 --> 01:17:31,895
