part like a photograph.

1778
01:17:42,876 --> 01:17:45,046
You were a really big
person when I was young.

1779
01:17:45,306 --> 01:17:48,576
I think Koo Young being in
this show is really amazing.

1780
01:17:49,376 --> 01:17:51,645
We worked together for a long time...

1781
01:17:51,646 --> 01:17:53,046
