1808
01:19:06,686 --> 01:19:09,126
I'm going to give it everything I've got.

1809
01:19:09,396 --> 01:19:11,666
It's win or nothing for me.

1810
01:19:11,796 --> 01:19:13,036
I'll just keep running forward.

1811
01:19:13,266 --> 01:19:15,495
